# redshift_templates (Data Source)

Lists COPY templates with their owners, for one schema or for every local schema of a database. See AWS
[SHOW TEMPLATES](https://docs.aws.amazon.com/redshift/latest/dg/r_SHOW_TEMPLATES.html).

## Catalog Query

```sql
SHOW TEMPLATES FROM SCHEMA schema;
```

