Items are ordered by schema and name. Without `schema`, the listing reads the local schemas of the database from
`SVV_ALL_SCHEMAS` and runs `SHOW TEMPLATES` for each, which fails when the provider's SQL identity lacks `USAGE` on one
of them. `id` combines the warehouse binding with the `database` and `schema` filters, or the provider database without
one.
